            "block_content": "(b) In no case shall the combination of Worker's Compensation and the additional amount provided in the preceding paragraph be greater than the respective sums specified in that paragraph, except as provided in paragraph (c) immediately below. In no case shall payments be made for any period except that the first seven (7) calendar days of such absence without payments being due to employee under the Worker's Disability Compensation Act for the same period.",
